n talks on Ukraine conflict in Delhi, Bishkek]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-military-solutions-eam-jaishankar-reveals-pm-modi-putin-talks-on-ukraine-conflict-in-delhi-bishkek/articleshow/135419174.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135419174.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar conveyed India's diplomatic commitment regarding the Ukraine conflict during discussions in Atlanta. His talks included priorities such as protecting civilian shipping and restoring crucial grain exports. Jaishankar also emphasized the need for energy security in light of ongoing disruptions. He met with counterparts from Russia, Poland, and South Korea to address bilateral and multilateral issues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-military-solutions-eam-jaishankar-reveals-pm-modi-putin-talks-on-ukraine-conflict-in-delhi-bishkek/articleshow/135419174.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-military-solutions-eam-jaishankar-reveals-pm-modi-putin-talks-on-ukraine-conflict-in-delhi-bishkek/articleshow/135419174.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T12:00:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135419771,imgsize-100592.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘A hurry to finish JD(U)’: RJD's Manoj Jha on MLCs who defeated Nitish's party joining BJP]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-hurry-to-finish-jdu-rjds-manoj-jha-attacks-bjp-over-mlcs-switch/articleshow/135419374.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135419374.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[h